  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ee38b9a3-8cbd-43de-9215-cb156cb0b6b5-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 224px;\" /><br />Let us assume that we connect&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>(whole number)&nbsp;capacitors in series such that the potential difference across the combination is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. This means the potential difference across&nbsp;each capacitor is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#10878;</mo><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>333</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>This means we need to connect at least&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;capacitors in series to make sure that the potential across each one is less than&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Minimum no. of capacitors&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>",
